(Driving in Singapore involves navigating a dense network of Electronic Road Pricing \(ERP\) gantries across) Tj
T* (expressways \(CTE, PIE, AYE, KPE, MCE, ECP\) and arterial roads \(Central Business District, Orchard, Bugis\). Toll) Tj
T* (rates fluctuate dynamic based on time-of-day, vehicle classification, and traffic congestion schedules.) Tj
