(Conventional navigation software \(e.g., standard Google Maps or Waze\) evaluates routes primarily based on travel) Tj
T* (time or distance. They frequently fail to address the total cost of ownership per trip, often routing drivers through) Tj
T* (high-fee ERP gantries to save 1�2 minutes, or taking indirect detours that consume significantly more fuel than the toll) Tj
T* (avoided.) Tj
